\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces Best-fit CSS differenced displacement profiles for the Krafla post-diking dataset of \citet  {foulger1992post}. Observed rift-perpendicular displacements between $\tau _i = 8$~yr and $\tau _f = 11$~yr post-rifting are shown as filled circles with $1\sigma $ error bars (cm). Curves show the viscous CSS ($T$ free, purple; $T=200$~yr, dashed orange) and Maxwell CSS ($T$ free, navy; $T=200$~yr, dashed brown), with $\tau _R$ derived from $a$ via Equation~(\ref {eq:tau_R_shared}); see Table~\ref {tab:krafla_css} and text for parameter values and goodness-of-fit statistics.}}{11}{figure.8}\protected@file@percent }
